[Scenario 7] GROUP BY uses the hinted index (index scan)     

===================================================
cola    count(*)    
0     50000     
1     50000     
2     50000     

Query plan:
iscan
    class: tbl node[?]
    index: idx_non_covering term[?] (covers)
    filtr: term[?]
    sort:  ? asc
    cost:  ? card ?
Query stmt:
select tbl.cola, count(*) from tbl tbl where (tbl.cola>= ?:?  and tbl.cola<= ?:? ) and tbl.colb= ?:?  group by tbl.cola using index tbl.idx_non_covering
